{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0212_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "30e3fd5d7af8ad9f6b309959533b320d306d0debb13ea74037726afcb77aefbc", "ja": "はいっ！　実は昨日、\n風花さんに映画に誘ってもらっちゃったんです！", "zh": "是的！其实昨天，风花小姐邀请我一起看电影了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0212_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "c1996a982cb8cdb63ea3ce91aae4488e0bace48bb7ce1d37dff4dce44cbb4421", "ja": "アイドルちゃんとデートできるなんて、\n最高すぎますよぉ！　ムフフ、ムフ……♪", "zh": "能和偶像酱约会，真是太棒了呀！呜呼呼，呜呼……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0212_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9864c26521a4feb6c7e7d3c335cfe271751f3b6bec262626c91e3332119426bd", "ja": "よかったな！　でも、デートもいいけど、\nスケートの練習は進んでるのか？", "zh": "太好了！不过，约会归约会，\n滑冰练习有进展了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0212_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "bf259bed36e15562a872a346a55afb8ed2562620f03092506f3913af9793c7ac", "ja": "うっ！？　そ、それは……ありさ、運動はあまり\n得意じゃないので……その……えっと……！", "zh": "呜！？那、那个嘛……因为亚利沙不太擅长\n运动……那个……呃……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0212_1007_p", "source_sha256": "53cb0a90d1c231fef775b0e44e31c5fb5580481d4b6387f21b4edc09ea8d944d", "ja": "ほらほら、だったら特訓だ。\n今日は星梨花や翼も一緒だから。出発するぞ。", "zh": "好了好了，既然这样就特训吧。\n今天还有星梨花和翼一起。出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0212_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0212_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "4a8c25b3f8ffae94ca9865d90b732189127df66ce05ca3fe915534be7190a594", "ja": "はっ！？　それは、おふたりの練習が見られるという\nこと……ふおぉーっ、ありさ、がんばりますっ！", "zh": "啊！？也就是说，能看到两位的练习……呜哦——！亚利沙会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
